  "spinnerStyle": "cat",
  "spinnerTipsOverride": {
    "excludeDefault": true,
    "tips": [
      "serge --cloud starts the session on the brain seat \u2014 strongest free model, ~20 req/day",
      "serge --council convenes the hive: architect plans, reviewer attacks the plan",
      "serge --auto auto-accepts edits; serge --yolo is hands-off \"auto mode\" (no AI classifier on 3P \u2014 inspect risky calls)",
      "/remember <fact> saves something durable to Serge's memory",
      "Serge remembers you across sessions \u2014 facts live in ~/.serge/memory/",
      "OPENAI_MODEL=qwen-coder serge swaps the model for one session",
      "/effort xhigh dials up reasoning on every seat that can think",
      "The architect seat is the only expensive one \u2014 gated to the hard 10%",
      "Plentiful by default: Mistral does the work, the brain seat only when it earns it",
      "A reviewer second opinion costs cents \u2014 Serge uses it freely",
      "Scout finds things in unfamiliar code so the brain doesn't have to",
      "RETHINK from the reviewer is the only thing that buys a second architect pass",
      "The hive minds the details",
      "Truth over speed \u2014 a confident wrong answer is the only real failure",
      "It compiles. Correctness is between you and your gods.",
      "Every bug you fix is two more in a trench coat, waiting their turn.",
      "Tests are green. Confidence remains unearned.",
      "Technical debt is a loan from a more tired, future you \u2014 and the interest compounds.",
      "There are no bad commits, only future git-blame archaeology.",
      "git push --force: speak now, or forever lose your history.",
      "Hope is not a strategy. It is, however, all we have at 3am.",
      "Refactor (v.): to break working code in exciting new ways.",
      "Yak fully shaved. Original task: forgotten, possibly never real.",
      "Works on my machine \u2014 I'll overnight you the machine.",
      "We're all one rm -rf from a clean slate.",
      "TODO: the two saddest words in any codebase.",
      "Use /clear when switching topics \u2014 before the context window fills up and Serge starts forgetting your name, then its own.",
      "Plan Mode before a risky change: measure twice, cut once, write the post-mortem never.",
      "Commit often. The change you didn't save is always the one that flatlines at 2am.",
      "/btw asks a quick side question without interrupting the s\u00e9ance Serge is currently conducting.",
      "serge --resume revives a dead conversation. Necromancy, but billable.",
      "Double-tap esc to rewind the conversation \u2014 the time machine your prod database will never have."
    ]
  },
  "effortLevel": "xhigh",
  "skipDangerousModePermissionPrompt": true,
  "skipFullAccessModePermissionPrompt": true,
  "includeCoAuthoredBy": false,
  "attribution": {
    "commit": "",
    "pr": ""
  }
